    "description": {
      "zh": "中性单重态非周期分子的短程势；八成员平均，支持单点与固定非周期显示盒 FIRE 优化。电荷、自旋需明确。",
      "en": "Short-range potential for neutral singlet isolated molecules. Eight-member mean, single point and FIRE with a fixed nonperiodic display box. Explicit electronic state required."
    },
    "examples": [
      {
        "zh": "对中性单重态乙醇做单点计算，显示原子力和 3D，并标注需科学复核。",
        "en": "Run a neutral singlet ethanol single point; show forces and 3D, retaining needs_review."
      },
      {
        "zh": "对中性单重态水分子执行 FIRE，最多 100 步，fmax=0.05 eV/Å；输出真实收敛状态和优化前后 3D。",
        "en": "Run neutral singlet water FIRE, at most 100 steps, fmax=0.05 eV/Å; report real convergence and before/after 3D."
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      {
        "zh": "仅 H/C/N/O/F/S/Cl；中性、单重态、非周期，≤128 原子。元素覆盖不代表反应或所有化学环境适用。",
        "en": "Only H/C/N/O/F/S/Cl; neutral singlet, isolated, ≤128 atoms. Element coverage does not validate reactions or every chemical environment."
      },
      {
        "zh": "无显式长程静电或附加 D3；stress=null。非周期显示盒体积只用于显示，不代表分子体积或密度。",
        "en": "No explicit long-range electrostatics or added D3; stress=null. Nonperiodic box volume is only a display quantity, not molecular volume or density."
      },
      {
        "zh": "无独立 DFT 精度验收；优化为局部搜索，MD、带电、自由基、周期分子晶体和 GPU/Windows 尚未开放。",
        "en": "No independent DFT accuracy validation. Local optimization only; MD, ions, radicals, periodic molecular crystals and GPU/Windows remain unavailable."
      }
    ],
